<body>
    <h1>Presentation Reference</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>There may be specific use cases that require Gold EDM data be gr=
ouped or manipulated to fulfill requirements.&nbsp; For example, requiremen=
ts may be raised for third parties to see reports or transmittal's grouped =
or banded in a certain way.</p>
<p>We don't want to make the EDM specific to any particular user and theref=
ore do not want additional attributes to fulfill these bandings.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>In order to fulfill this need, we have a presentation reference area (pr=
stn_ref) which can be joined to from the Gold Layer and return the required=
 bandings.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Principally, we should only have one presentation reference table for ea=
ch type that we need to do, hence the PRSTN_REF_TYPE_NAME.&nbsp; This enabl=
es us to add groupings in the different third parties/requirements.&nbsp; T=
here are also from and until dates to track any change if required.</p>
<h2 id=3D"PresentationReference-Example1-RangeGrouping">Example 1 - Range G=
rouping</h2>
<h1 id=3D"PresentationReference-prstn_ref.excess_amt_mapping_group">prstn_r=
ef.excess_amt_mapping_group</h1>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"99" src=3D"d55aab3caae0ff2e77bfdc05c7320b27395b183217715ec64da2acacac6=
e36d1" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160794029/image2022-9-29_13-=
58-10.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664456290000&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160794046" dat=
a-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" da=
ta-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_13-58-10.png" data-base-=
url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"i=
mage/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160794029" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-version=3D"2" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></=
p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Usage:</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"93" src=3D"82b42d6c8762363c11ed6b7e3bf7e5b342bc6c08d3cd73e8d950cf05d06=
020ea" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160794029/image2022-9-29_14-=
5-28.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664456728000&amp;api=3Dv2" dat=
a-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160794067" data=
-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" dat=
a-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_14-5-28.png" data-base-ur=
l=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"ima=
ge/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160794029" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-version=3D"2" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
<p><br></p>
<h2 id=3D"PresentationReference-Example2-CodeGrouping">Example 2 - Code Gro=
uping</h2>
<p>Code grouping that requires a direct link from the model should have the=
 same attribute names as the EDM.</p>
<h1 id=3D"PresentationReference-prstn_ref.undwg_result_mapping_group">prstn=
_ref.undwg_result_mapping_group</h1>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"76" src=3D"e827f4fea374f7469f996979dc778c9725d3e817bff49034d5f0ced565a=
1c984" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160794029/image2022-9-29_13-=
58-41.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664456321000&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160794051" dat=
a-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" da=
ta-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_13-58-41.png" data-base-=
url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"i=
mage/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160794029" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-version=3D"2" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></=
p>
<p>Usage:</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"132" src=3D"c1aaaaa5ca4a2fae6d81e0ed6fbf414f1714a063138c31e71ee173bbd8=
68c50e" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160794029/image2022-9-29_14=
-4-37.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664456677000&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160794065" dat=
a-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" da=
ta-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_14-4-37.png" data-base-u=
rl=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"im=
age/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160794029" data-linked-resour=
ce-container-version=3D"2" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p=
>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"PresentationReference-PresentationReferenceLoadProcess">Presentat=
ion Reference Load Process</h1>
<p>Loading presentation reference data is a simple process.</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7e31a266-6478-4a25-993e-ad1977915884">Create your require=
d prsnt_ref file under \\<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://lgavs01-=
fe.group.net" rel=3D"nofollow">lgavs01-fe.group.net</a>\gi azure file sourc=
es\curated_ref_data_stg\Inbound\prstn_ref\ (BLD) first and then copy the fi=
le as the changes are tested and promoted up to TST and LVE.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dd356450-20e7-4854-897e-d967c6c40b11">Run the ADF pipelin=
e&nbsp;<strong>curated_ref_data_stg_RunPipelineMaster, </strong>specifying =
the worksheet/excel document you wish to load, example:=20
  <div class=3D"table-wrap">
   <table style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;" class=3D"confluenceTable">
    <thead class=3D"">
     <tr class=3D"">
      <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">
       <p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;">Name</p></th>
      <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">
       <p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;">Type</p></th>
      <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">
       <p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;">Value</p></th>
     </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class=3D"" style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;">
     <tr class=3D"" style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;">
      <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;"><span>RefType</span></p></td>
      <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">string</td>
      <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">prstn_ref</td>
     </tr>
     <tr class=3D"" style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;">
      <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;"><span>Truncate_Flag</span></p></td=
>
      <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">string</td>
      <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">Y</td>
     </tr>
     <tr class=3D"" style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;">
      <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;"><span>SheetName</span></p></td>
      <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">string</td>
      <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">annual_mileage=
_group.csv</td>
     </tr>
    </tbody>
   </table>
  </div></li>
</ol>
<p>Once loaded the new table will be available under <strong>curated_ref_da=
ta_stg.prstn_ref<span style=3D"color:#1d7afc;"><em>_&nbsp;</em></span></str=
ong></p>
<p>with the file name appended i.e. &nbsp;<em><span style=3D"color:#1d7afc;=
">curated_ref_data_stg.prstn_ref_annual_mileage_group</span></em></p>
<p>You can then reference the these in gold table logic.&nbsp;</p>
<p>If end users need visibility of the reference data, you will need to cre=
ate a view under <strong>prsnt_ref,</strong> pointing&nbsp;to your underlyi=
ng <span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">curated_ref_data_stg view.</span></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
